{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clown Is Hungry is a comedy horror game about delivering a pizza to a hungry clown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Kat, who has to deliver a pizza late at night, and she's already late for a party. The town is quiet and empty, but this neighborhood seems to be sinister and creepy. Kat finds weird signs in people's front yards and in the street warning about pizza and to never deliver pizza here. Kat decides that she has to do her job anyway and ignores the warnings, but soon she realizes that they are there for a reason as she knocks on the door of the last house on the street, where the clown lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game tells a comedic and creepy story, where the player gets to explore creepy places while trying to deliver the pizza. There are puzzles to solve, survive encounters with the clown and secrets to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gameplay varies from exploration to unique puzzle solving to survival horror. Kat keeps getting herself into trouble but she must deliver the pizza because the clown is hungry.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3351330?t=1745435513","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3351330?t=1745435513","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351330/9cee106982cf53693f2a82fbee6fa41ac7eb8d9b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745435513","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351330/9cee106982cf53693f2a82fbee6fa41ac7eb8d9b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745435513","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game features elements of horror, fear and gore."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clown Is Hungry is a comedy horror game about delivering a pizza to a hungry clown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Kat, who has to deliver a pizza late at night, and she's already late for a party. The town is quiet and empty, but this neighborhood seems to be sinister and creepy. Kat finds weird signs in people's front yards and in the street warning about pizza and to never deliver pizza here. Kat decides that she has to do her job anyway and ignores the warnings, but soon she realizes that they are there for a reason as she knocks on the door of the last house on the street, where the clown lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game tells a comedic and creepy story, where the player gets to explore creepy places while trying to deliver the pizza. There are puzzles to solve, survive encounters with the clown and secrets to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gameplay varies from exploration to unique puzzle solving to survival horror. Kat keeps getting herself into trouble but she must deliver the pizza because the clown is hungry.</p>","developers":["Vidas Salavejus"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351330/header.jpg?t=1745435513","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257127280,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127280/movie480.mp4?t=1744900240","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127280/movie_max.mp4?t=1744900240"},"name":"Clown Is Hungry trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257127280/e66e45719d33cb72dc0d9415403d04e943892c0e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744900240","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127280/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744900240","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127280/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744900240"}}],"name":"Clown Is Hungry","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul